{"4478890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Birdies", "steam_appid": 4478890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleven years after World War I ended, the Great Depression began. Desperate for work and survival, scientists created a bird capable of eating anything. Then it tasted blood...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478890/extras/08a26d29411b3d54e81dac230da7414d.avif?t=1787241734\" width=1346 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) 20+ types of birds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Fight endless waves of birds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Hidden story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Simple pick-up-and-play gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) Defend the wall protecting the mini city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6) use 10+ different weapons to kill all kind of birds<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478890/extras/d0edb55f7b8334c7b60cfa1e532a1323.avif?t=1787241734\" width=1340 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Pistol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Shotgun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) AK-47</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Tommy Gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) Snipper Rifle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6) Auto Gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7) M1 Garand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8) Cross bolt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9) Flare gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4478890/extras/ab3139a68ce1daf873a561b6483015fa.avif?t=1787241734\" width=1339 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of bird